=C2=A0



=C2=A0
GLM-5.2 is currently the strongest open-model (MIT =
licensed) for coding and agentic tasks with 1M token context.
=C2=A0
It is available now on Ollama's cloud, hosted in the US on the latest =
NVIDIA Blackwell datacenter GPUs. Privacy policy and zero
data retention apply, as always.
=C2=A0



=C2=A0
GLM-5.2 can handle =
project-level engineering context, execute long-running tasks more reliably=
, follow engineering standards more
consistently, and complete the full =
development workflow from requirements to multi-platform deployment in a =
single task.
=C2=A0




Try GLM-5.2

Get started with GLM-5.2 using your =
favorite tools:
=C2=A0
Claude Code
ollama launch claude --model glm-5.=
2:cloud

Codex App
ollama launch codex-app --model glm-5.2:cloud
=C2=A0
Hermes Agent
ollama launch hermes --model glm-5.2:cloud
=C2=A0
OpenClaw =F0=9F=A6=9E
ollama launch openclaw --model glm-5.2:cloud
=C2=A0
Ollama's cloud supports direct API usage [https://docs.ollama.com/cloud] as=
 well.
=C2=A0
Learn more about the model and integrations from the Ollama =
model page [https://ollama.com/library/glm-5.2].
=C2=A0

Download Ollama [https://ollama.com/download]

=C2=A0
If you have any feedback, please directly reply to this email or join =
Ollama's Discord channel
[https://discord.com/invite/ollama].
